{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y对人物心理动机和因果转折的解释有所压缩，例如疲惫如何变成难受、为什么用受过的气压住想念，X交代得更完整；少数短段的定时感受也略显密集。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的话语更短，重点词有醒目的视觉锚点，扫屏时更容易迅速抓住每段发生了什么；定时出现的感受又能把具体声响、动作、情绪和音乐变化联系起来，不只是给人物贴情绪标签。尤其是“自己人—亲近—孤单—不为孤单回头”这条线反复出现并逐步变化，让前后很容易连成一个完整的故事。X的心理解释更充分，但综合实际观看和听音乐时能接收到的信息，我会选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4acbf6ae-2d3a-4ac4-ae89-fccb879833b1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T115457656751Z", "elapsed_seconds": 91.453, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T11:56:29.117113+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a9c99d948f0e2de2e637ec0a3fb4c7ab08bc67de89b6ae877dba4dc0aabe1069", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web